<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the</p>
<p>$6 million Grand Slam Cup tennis tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-3 6-4  </p>
<p>Jakob Hlasek (Switzerland) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
